SUMMARY:Tooleys café (Mon Coffee)
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nCome out to socialize and enjoy a good cup 
 of coffee at Tooleys cafe\nWe will be meeting every Monday from 9:30 - 10:
 30 EST.\nTooleys Café.\n1729 Brevard Rd\, Laurel Park\,\nIn the Laurel Pa
 rk Village Shopping Mall.\n**Please keep your RSVP's updated\; I need to l
 et the staff know how many chairs to 'reserve'.**\nHome-cooked style menu\
 ; family owned. ($$)\nOpen 9 AM-3 PM weekdays\nTooley's Cafe is a cozy spo
 t in the Laurel Park Village Shopping Mall\, offering a variety of menu it
 ems\, fast and friendly service\, and daily specials. The restaurant is kn
 own for its reliably good food\, including its signature turkey sandwich a
 nd sides. Breakfast and lunch are served\, with a familiar yet varied menu
 .\nMenu\n[https://places.singleplatform.com/tooleys-cafe-2/menu?ref=google
 ](https://places.singleplatform.com/tooleys-cafe-2/menu?ref=google)\n[http
 s://restaurantguru.com/Tooleys-Cafe-Hendersonville](https://restaurantguru
 .com/Tooleys-Cafe-Hendersonville)\n[https://www.yelp.com/biz/tooleys-cafe-
 hendersonville](https://www.yelp.com/biz/tooleys-cafe-hendersonville)\nI p
 ersonally recommend the Rhubarb-Strawberry Homemade pie !!!!
